    "body": "In Bun v1.1.5, we are adding bundler & runtime support for `text`, `json` & `toml`. `text` is UTF-8 and replaces invalid UTF-8 with FFD. We probably will support BOM later to handle UTF-16. Named imports (excluding default) with `type: “text”` throw an error at parse time. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/oven-sh/bun/pull/10456",
