    "created_at": "2025-09-20T03:31:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-20T03:31:42Z",
    "body": "It would probably be worth considering `Blob` imports as well as, [as others have pointed out elsewhere](https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/25354#issuecomment-2808843308), text/array buffers will persist in memory even if they're only used once/rarely.\n\ne.g.:\n\n```ts\nimport spriteBlob from \"./sprite.png\" with { type: \"blob\" };\n\n// Sometime later\nconst spriteBitmap = await createImageBitmap(spriteBlob);\n\n// ... render on canvas\n\n// free image memory\nspriteBitmap.close();\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
