    "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:16:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-29T16:17:07Z",
    "body": "I've put together [proposal-import-text](https://github.com/eemeli/proposal-import-text), which I plan to present at the upcoming TC39 meeting.\n\nExamples of its intended behaviour are included in the corresponding [test262 PR](https://github.com/tc39/test262/pull/4607).\n\nBriefly, it would add support for\n```js\nimport text from \"path/to/file.txt\" with { type: \"text\" };\n```\nwith no affordance for other encodings than UTF-8; for those, you'd need to import as `bytes` and decode separately:\n```js\nimport uint8array from \"path/to/file.txt\" with { type: \"bytes\" };\nlet text = new TextDecoder(\"utf-16le\").decode(uint8array);\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/3462527442/reactions",
